;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-aac1ab9b2602b5c2f5dc5243e2a79bcb43e6a1d15ba0c5a7e506f4f8df4f5f4a","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"凯迪拉克确认洛登离队并非“双方协商一致”","summaryZh":"凯迪拉克F1车队证实，格雷姆·洛登被解职并非双方协商一致的决定，且他仅在当天早上才得知此事。周三，凯迪拉克突然宣布由前阿尔派执行总监马尔钦·布德科夫斯基接替洛登，担任2026赛季剩余时间及以后的车队负责人。这一决定是在夏季停摆期间做出的。","publishedAt":"2026-08-19T13:41:42.688Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-12T17:12:35.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"autosport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Autosport","byline":"Autosport","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-1.motorsport.com/images/amp/YWKwrzVY/s6/graeme-lowdon-dan-towriss-pat--2.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":231919,"altZh":"凯迪拉克确认洛登离队并非“双方协商一致”"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.autosport.com/f1/news/cadillac-confirms-lowdons-exit-wasnt-mutual/10845973/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-a15596e7b7841154e72fc024c8e7baa84c6260ebc3202ce095862d25cbf2f33f","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"布德科夫斯基接替洛登出任凯迪拉克F1车队领队","summaryZh":"凯迪拉克F1车队任命马尔钦·布德科夫斯基为新任车队领队，接替格雷姆·洛登。49岁的布德科夫斯基在过去25年中担任过多种职务，曾在普罗斯特、法拉利和迈凯伦担任空气动力学专家，之后负责FIA的F1技术部门。离开FIA后，他加入了雷诺车队。","publishedAt":"2026-08-19T11:24:42.357Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-12T14:26:58.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"autosport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Autosport","byline":"Autosport","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-6.motorsport.com/images/amp/27No5Lx0/s6/marcin-budkowski-cadillac-3.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":147376,"altZh":"布德科夫斯基接替洛登出任凯迪拉克F1车队领队"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.autosport.com/f1/news/budkowski-replaces-lowdon-as-cadillac-f1-boss/10845943/?utm_source=RSS&